* ident_call2 -- counts to 1000, testing IDENT(count, count) once per step (the 2-arg predicate).
* bottleneck: one 2-arg IDENT() call per iteration.
        count = 0
        i = 1
loop    count = count + 1
        IDENT(count, count)
        i = LT(i, 1000) i + 1                           :S(loop)
        OUTPUT = 'ident_call2(1000) = ' count
END
